      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Bethnal Green Gardens Conservation Area, designated in 1969 and extended in 2008, protects historic buildings around the tube station junction.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
