      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bethnal_Green",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "St Barnabas Church on Grove Road, opposite Mile End Park, was founded in 1870 and remains an active parish.",
